<title>USA: Atrium Co issues $100 mln 144a debt, yl 10.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Atrium Co issues $100 mln 144a debt, yl 10.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144a debt issue from Atrium Co was priced in the private placement market on Friday, according to a high-yield syndicate source.</p>
<p>BT Securities Corp is lead manager on the deal.</p>
<p>BORROWER ATRIUM CO</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 10.50 PCT  MATURITY 11/15/2006</p>
<p>TYPE SNR SUB NOTES ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 5/15/1997 LAST MOODY'S B3    YIELD 10.50 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-B			  CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212-859-1672</p>
